#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Intee jeer ayaa xogta la ururiyaa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr "Haddii la hawlgeliyo, Evidence wuxuu xog ururin doonaa marar joogto ah. Haddii La joojiyay, waxaad kaliya arki kartaa xogta Martigeliye gaar ah."

